WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.800 --> 00:00:05.200
Narrator: Pressure, heat and long waits make people short-tempered.

2
00:00:05.900 --> 00:00:13.400
Narrator: When people don't know what's happening, they fill the gap with rumours - and phones spread them in minutes.

3
00:00:14.800 --> 00:00:16.800
Narrator: The answer is information.

4
00:00:17.200 --> 00:00:23.400
Narrator: Tell people what is happening, using facts from your supervisor.

5
00:00:23.800 --> 00:00:26.500
Narrator: Never guess, and never repeat a rumour.

